    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: 'By hand: This pizza has been in here SINCE THE 25TH. EAT IT or THROW IT
    OUT. Nobody is coming back for it.

    By hand: There is a turkey in there too
    and that is GENE''S BIRTHDAY TURKEY. Have some respect. The man only turns 52
    once. Leave it.'
